## Box role

[TBox (`gmeow:boxTBox`)](../../four-boxes/index.md)

## Constraints

- An AffectComposite must declare at least one gmeow:affectiveConstituent — a named compound with no decomposition is a forbidden unanalyzed primitive \(model up from axes, or add the missing axis\)\.

